  "owner_approval": {
    "date": "2026-09-20",
    "exact_text": "Approved: SSMC-2 shall use the bounded Channel/W-I single-sided miter topology with one connected web-following polygon plate and 2x2/3x2 serial bolt groups; full serial N/V/M transport with native Slice-8 demand only for the qualified planar equal-stiffness component and no action halving or axial-row mixing; explicit preservation of all one-sided secondary moments with fail-closed complete response unless a server-trusted qualified response is bound; the plate-only MITER_PLATE_CW_BASIS_UNKNOWN_CUT policy with no LW fallback or fictitious isotropy; fail-closed polygon resistance and member flange-to-web transfer until qualified authority exists; and independent hardware authority with SSMC-2 released only as a geometry+demand/source-ready engineering-review milestone, not a complete moment-capacity PASS."
  },
